notes.content:
Hello everyone!

After taking a break for over a month following the wedding, I finally mustered the energy to complete the [u][b]Summer Holiday Version[/b][/u] update. Here are the updates:

[olist]
[*] Added some exciting new music tracks;
[*] Introduced a new main menu Easter egg;
[*] Added a new player item - the Hourglass, which has a time-stopping feature for emergencies!
[*] Optimized obstacle and vehicle generation logic to reduce difficulty;
[*] Improved the scoring algorithm;
[*] Enhanced the UI and some UI animations;
[*] Added graphics settings and BGM toggle;
[*] Added Japanese and English localization.
[/olist]

Thank you all for your support, and I hope you enjoy the game!

Next update plans ([strike]release date TBD[/strike]):

[olist]
[*] Performance optimization;
[*] More Easter eggs;
[*] Customizable characters;
[*] Achievement system;
[*] Global ranking system;
[*] Improved controller feel;
[*] More game settings (toggle fullscreen, resolution, etc.).
[/olist]

[b]Long-term goals:
More game modes[/b]

Thank you for your continued support! Enjoy the game! Cheers!

